@startuml
title Signals
header draft
footer end
caption a sample
scale 2 as 20 pixels
clock "Tick" as clk with period 2
binary "Enable" as EN
analog "Level" between 0 and 5 as L
concise "Data" as db
@0
EN is low
L is 0
db is "0x00"
@5
EN is high : ready
L is 3
db is "0xA0"
EN@5 -> db@8 : sample
@10
EN is low
L is 5
db is "0xFF"
@enduml
